exports[`e-mails de cobranca payment-approved (en) 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Payment confirmed: your Mentor plan is active",
  "text": "Your payment went through

Hi, Ana. Your Mentor plan is active and the teacher portal is ready. Start by bringing your students into the class.

Open the portal: https://opusatlas.com.br/teacher

R$39.90 (Mentor · monthly)
Plan: Mentor
Billing: Monthly
Amount: R$39.90
Date: October 12, 2026

Warmly,
The Opus Atlas team

---
Billed by Stripe, in Brazilian reais. To change or cancel your plan, go to My profile → Account settings. Within 7 days of subscribing you can cancel and get your money back.
opusatlas.com.br · São Paulo, Brazil",
}
`;

