exports[`e-mails de conta google-account-reset (en) 1`] = `
{
  "subject": "Your account signs in with Google",
  "text": "Your account doesn't have its own password

Hi, Ana. You sign in to Opus Atlas with your Google account, so the password that counts is your Google one.
To change it, use Google's security settings.

Open Google security: https://myaccount.google.com/security

Warmly,
The Opus Atlas team

---
We got a new password request for this email. If it wasn't you, you can ignore it.
opusatlas.com.br · São Paulo, Brazil",
}
`;

